'''Fetchur''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}. They ask players to find a specific item every day as a quest.

== Mechanics ==
All players get the same request each day, and it changes for everyone at the same time, regardless of whether the player delivered the item the previous day or not. The quest can only be completed once per day, and it resets every night at midnight [[Hypixel Server Time]], which is either 4 AM or 5 AM [[w:UTC|UTC]] depending on [[w:Daylight saving time in the United States|U.S. daylight saving time]].

=== Rewards ===
Upon giving '''Fetchur''' the correct amount of the requested item, the player receives {{C|20k}} and {{Mithril Powder|2,500}}. The {{Mithril Powder}} bonus is affected by the ''Powder Buff'' [[Heart of the Mountain#Perks List|HotM perk]]. Although not mentioned in the message, it is also affected by the [[2x Powder]] event. The player also receives {{Bits|10}}, multiplied by their [[Fame Ranks|Bits Multiplier]], as long as they have enough {{Bits}} available.

=== Requests Cycle ===
The requested item cycles through a list of 12 different possible items. The cycle restarts each month with [[Yellow Stained Glass]].
